description: >-
  classDiagram-v2 with a namespace given a custom display label (namespace
  Auth["Authentication Service"]) distinct from its identifier, containing two classes
  related by a labeled dependency.
---
classDiagram-v2
  namespace Auth["Authentication Service"] {
  class UserService {
    +login()
    +logout()
  }
  class TokenManager {
    +generate()
  }
  }
  UserService --> TokenManager : uses

